---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="观测能力 — Dex AGENT"
  description="三个视角，同一份运行状态：3D 插件图谱、执行流 DAG、时间线。"
  current="/observe/"
>
  <section class="obs-hero">
    <div class="container obs-hero-inner">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">OBSERVE / FIELD MANUAL 001</p>
        <h1>观测，<br />不是日志。</h1>
        <p>三个视角，同一份运行状态：结构、过程、时间。不是把日志换一种颜色，而是让每一步都有位置、有因果、有回退。</p>
        <div class="obs-tabs">
          <a href="#graph">3D 图谱</a>
          <a href="#dag">执行流</a>
          <a href="#time">时间线</a>
          <a href="#linkage">联动</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="obs-side" aria-label="观测概览">
        <div class="row"><span>VIEWS</span><b>3</b></div>
        <div class="row"><span>GRAPH</span><b>500 NODES</b></div>
        <div class="row"><span>BASELINE</span><b>101 FPS</b></div>
        <div class="row"><span>P95 FRAME</span><b>12.5 MS</b></div>
        <div class="row"><span>DATA</span><b>LOCAL-FIRST</b></div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="chapter" id="graph">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="chapter-head"><div class="fig">FIG. 01</div><h2>结构是空间的。</h2><p class="note">类型 / 状态 / 连接度 / 依赖边</p></div>
      <div class="chapter-body">
        <div class="chapter-text">
          <p class="lead">插件不是列表里的一行。它占一个位置，连着几条边，带着自己的状态。图谱让“它由什么构成”变成可以走进去的空间。</p>
          <ul class="notes">
            <li><span class="k">TYPE</span><span class="v"><b>颜色 = 类型。</b>模型、工具、技能、调度、沙箱、其他。</span></li>
            <li><span class="k">STATUS</span><span class="v"><b>光环 = 状态。</b>运行、成功、失败、未激活。</span></li>
            <li><span class="k">EDGE</span><span class="v"><b>边 = 关系。</b>inject 依赖与运行时调用。</span></li>
          </ul>
          <p class="margin-note">节点大小 = 连接度 / 活跃度。布局稳定，聚焦子图而不是重新排列。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="chapter-figure">
          <figure class="plate">
            <div class="plate-bar"><span>PLATE 01 / GRAPH</span><span class="live"><i></i>OBSERVED</span></div>
            <img src="/images/screens/graph-space.png" width="1188" height="1033" loading="lazy" alt="3D 插件图谱：彩色节点表示插件类型与状态，细线表示依赖。" />
            <figcaption><b>fig. 01</b> — 3D plugin graph / 500 nodes</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="encoding" style="margin-top:40px">
        <div><b>TYPE / 颜色</b><h3>插件类型</h3><p>模型、工具、技能、调度、沙箱、其他。颜色来自 graph token，不是装饰。</p></div>
        <div><b>STATUS / 光环</b><h3>运行状态</h3><p>运行、成功、失败、未激活。颜色之外还有环粗与标签文字，三重编码。</p></div>
        <div><b>SIZE / 大小</b><h3>连接度</h3><p>节点越大，连接越多、越活跃。不是随机尺寸。</p></div>
        <div><b>EDGE / 边</b><h3>依赖与调用</h3><p>inject 依赖与运行时调用分开表达；调用越频繁，边越粗。</p></div>
      </div>
      <p class="margin-note" style="margin-top:24px">想看每个插件的职责、依赖与边界？<a class="text-link" href="/atlas/">打开插件档案 →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="chapter" id="dag">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="chapter-head"><div class="fig">FIG. 02</div><h2>过程是因果的。</h2><p class="note">Turn / Step / Tool Call / 失败传播</p></div>
      <div class="chapter-body reverse">
        <div class="chapter-text">
          <p class="lead">Step 是节点，Tool Call 是节点里的证据。失败不是一行红字，而是一条向上传播的路径。点一下失败节点，右侧详情面板给出原因、堆栈、推理文本与工具返回。</p>
          <ul class="notes">
            <li><span class="k">STEP</span><span class="v"><b>默认紧凑。</b>序号、状态、一行推理摘要。</span></li>
            <li><span class="k">TOOL</span><span class="v"><b>工具调用是证据。</b>工具名、入参、返回、耗时。</span></li>
            <li><span class="k">FAIL</span><span class="v"><b>失败有方向。</b>变红，并向上传播到 Turn。</span></li>
          </ul>
          <p class="margin-note">Step 与 Tool Call 的选中状态会同步到 3D 图谱；折叠面板不会丢状态。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="chapter-figure">
          <div class="dag-paper">
            <div class="dag-top"><span><b>TURN 01</b> · 检查构建脚本并给出修改建议</span><span>1 FAILED</span></div>
            <div class="dag-steps">
              <div class="step"><div class="idx"><span>STEP 01</span><i></i></div><b>读取构建配置</b><p>read package.json</p></div>
              <div class="step run"><div class="idx"><span>STEP 02</span><i></i></div><b>定位构建脚本</b><p>grep electron.vite</p></div>
              <div class="step"><div class="idx"><span>STEP 03</span><i></i></div><b>修改配置</b><p>edit defineConfig</p></div>
              <div class="step fail"><div class="idx"><span>STEP 04</span><i></i></div><b>运行检查失败</b><p>test · exit 1</p></div>
              <div class="dag-tools"><span class="tool"><i></i>read · 118ms</span><span class="tool"><i></i>grep · 42ms</span><span class="tool"><i></i>edit · 26ms</span><span class="tool" style="border-color:#C92F33"><i style="background:#C92F33"></i>test · failed</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="dag-foot"><span>STRUCTURE DIAGRAM / EXAMPLE DATA</span><span>LAYOUT · ELKJS</span></div>
            <div class="trace-detail">
              <div class="td-head"><span>DETAIL / STEP 04</span><span class="fail">FAILED</span></div>
              <div class="td-grid">
                <div><span class="k">REASON</span><b>test · exit 1</b></div>
                <div><span class="k">TOOL</span><b>test</b></div>
                <div><span class="k">DURATION</span><b>2.1s</b></div>
              </div>
              <p class="td-note">失败节点变红并向上传播到 Turn。详情面板给出错误原因、堆栈、当时的推理文本与工具返回。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="chapter" id="time">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="chapter-head"><div class="fig">FIG. 03</div><h2>时间是可回退的。</h2><p class="note">时间线 / 回放 / 上下文还原</p></div>
      <div class="chapter-body">
        <div class="chapter-text">
          <p class="lead">按时间排列事件流，与 DAG 联动。回退到任意 Step，查看当时的上下文；回放一次执行，而不是猜它发生过什么。</p>
          <ul class="notes">
            <li><span class="k">REWIND</span><span class="v"><b>回到任意 Step。</b>上下文、工具返回、推理文本都还原。</span></li>
            <li><span class="k">REPLAY</span><span class="v"><b>重新走一遍。</b>时间线与 DAG 共用同一套事件。</span></li>
          </ul>
          <p class="margin-note">回放不是录屏：它重建的是状态，不是像素。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="chapter-figure">
          <figure class="plate">
            <div class="plate-bar"><span>PLATE 03 / TIMELINE</span><span>REAL UI</span></div>
            <img src="/images/screens/timeline-rewind.png" width="1088" height="1291" loading="lazy" alt="时间线：选中第 15 步失败节点，底部详情面板显示工具调用、相关插件与权限策略。" />
            <figcaption><b>fig. 03</b> — timeline / inspect a failed step / tool calls &amp; context</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="chapter" id="linkage">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="chapter-head"><div class="fig">FIG. 04</div><h2>三个视角，一份状态。</h2><p class="note">L1 状态同步 / L2 过滤 / L3 空间导航</p></div>
      <div class="chapter-body">
        <div class="chapter-text">
          <p class="lead">点击 DAG 里的 Step，图谱中对应插件高亮；选中图谱里的工具节点，DAG 过滤出调用它的 Step。折叠不丢状态，展开立即呈现。</p>
          <ul class="notes">
            <li><span class="k">L1</span><span class="v"><b>状态同步。</b>高亮与选中在两个视图之间同步。</span></li>
            <li><span class="k">L2</span><span class="v"><b>过滤联动。</b>按工具筛选 Step。</span></li>
            <li><span class="k">L3</span><span class="v"><b>空间导航。</b>相机飞行到节点。</span></li>
          </ul>
          <p class="margin-note">下面是一个可点击的联动示意；不是实时数据。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="chapter-figure">
          <div class="linkage">
            <div class="linkage-top"><span>LINKAGE / L1 · L2</span><button type="button" id="linkage-reset">重置</button></div>
            <div class="linkage-grid">
              <div>
                <div class="linkage-col-title">DAG / STEPS</div>
                <div class="linkage-steps">
                  <button class="linkage-step" type="button" data-node="n1"><span>Step 02 · 定位构建脚本</span><b>grep</b></button>
                  <button class="linkage-step" type="button" data-node="n2"><span>Step 03 · 修改配置</span><b>edit</b></button>
                  <button class="linkage-step" type="button" data-node="n3"><span>Step 04 · 运行测试</span><b>test</b></button>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="linkage-col-title">GRAPH / PLUGINS</div>
                <div class="linkage-graph">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 320 210" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="none" stroke="#D4D4D4"><path d="M78 76L166 50"/><path d="M166 50L238 116"/><path d="M78 76L238 116"/></g></svg>
                  <button class="linkage-node n1" type="button" data-node="n1" aria-label="插件 grep">grep</button>
                  <button class="linkage-node n2" type="button" data-node="n2" aria-label="插件 edit">edit</button>
                  <button class="linkage-node n3" type="button" data-node="n3" aria-label="插件 test">test</button>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="linkage-caption" id="linkage-caption">选择一个 Step，或点击一个插件节点。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="chapter">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="chapter-head"><div class="fig">PERFORMANCE</div><h2>先过性能关，再谈视觉。</h2><p class="note">500 节点基准 / 本机开发环境</p></div>
      <div class="obs-stats">
        <div><b>500</b><span>节点 / NODES</span></div>
        <div><b>101</b><span>FPS / LOCAL BASELINE</span></div>
        <div><b>12.5</b><span>P95 FRAME / MS</span></div>
      </div>
      <p class="margin-note" style="margin-top:14px">数值来自 2026-10-30 本机开发环境 5 秒采样，实际取决于硬件与场景。图谱采用增量更新、LOD 降级与稳定引脚策略。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBand secondaryHref="/#fig-01" secondaryLabel="回到第一张图" />
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  const steps = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.linkage-step'))
  const nodes = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.linkage-node'))
  const caption = document.getElementById('linkage-caption')
  const resetBtn = document.getElementById('linkage-reset')
  const labels: Record<string, string> = {
    n1: 'Step 02 选中 → 图谱中的 grep 插件高亮。',
    n2: 'Step 03 选中 → 图谱中的 edit 插件高亮。',
    n3: 'Step 04 选中 → 图谱中的 test 插件高亮。',
  }

  function clear() {
    steps.forEach((el) => el.classList.remove('is-active'))
    nodes.forEach((el) => el.classList.remove('is-linked'))
    if (caption) caption.textContent = '选择一个 Step，或点击一个插件节点。'
  }

  function select(id: string) {
    clear()
    steps.forEach((el) => { if (el.dataset.node === id) el.classList.add('is-active') })
    nodes.forEach((el) => { if (el.dataset.node === id) el.classList.add('is-linked') })
    if (caption) caption.textContent = labels[id] ?? '联动已选中。'
  }

  steps.forEach((el) => el.addEventListener('click', () => select(el.dataset.node ?? '')))
  nodes.forEach((el) => el.addEventListener('click', () => select(el.dataset.node ?? '')))
  resetBtn?.addEventListener('click', clear)
</script>
